ex:Mission14 a backlog:Mission ;
    rdfs:label "Chapters 21 to 25 decks and pages meet the owner's rulings on decks and pages"@en ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin "Owner's instructions 2026-11-26: 18:57 Istanbul 'after 16-20, the next is the 21-25. After the completion we will return back to initial chapters' (queued, register 1.21.0 of Lineage13) and 20:18 Istanbul 'Fine, proceed' after Lineage13 closed." ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_InFlight ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "The chapter 21 (Making Graphs and Manipulating Images), chapter 22 (Recognizing Text in Images), chapter 23 (Controlling the Keyboard and Mouse), chapter 24 (Text-to-Speech and Speech Recognition) and chapter 25 (Threads) decks and interactive pages are brought to the owner's rulings on decks and pages (one thing taught per slide, notes that carry the lecture and speak to the reader, a Slide code tab, a top menu item that runs the slide examples in order, plain code without prompts, only taught Python, no everyday analogies, two result balloons on every code slide, checks and reviews recorded before release), with each chapter's approved content, stories and examples unchanged except where a ruling forces a change, reusing the conversion built for chapters 10 to 20." ;
    backlog:missionFor ex:Backlog14,
        ex:Register_Ch2125corr .

